+## Rarefaction {#sec-rarefaction}
+
+Uneven sequencing read depth can bias diversity metrics. Rarefaction attempts
+to normalize read depth by repeatedly subsampling reads and computing
+an averaged metric[@Schloss2024rarefaction1;@Schloss2024rarefaction2]. 
+Rarefaction for alpha diversity metrics can be applied by specifying the optional
+arguments `sample` and `niter` in `addAlpha()`. Rarefaction is discussed in
+more detail in [@sec-rarefaction_ordination] where it is applied in
+the context of beta diversity. 
+
